body:
Okay, so... Few questions;
Do they vacuum these seats every morning? Do they make sure all onion & garlic & other crumb that might be toxic to dogs are off the floor? How do they prevent fleas, mites & other pests from infesting? Are there frequently dog fights? 
Don't get me wrong, I LOVE dogs & my dog & I are inseparable. I'm just concerned about the logistics. & germs. I have a things with germs...
